# Shared UI

Follow `.cursor/context/stack.md` and `.cursor/context/ui.md`. Empty `App.tsx` converts to Svelte 5 when filled. Do not add more React.

## Placement

- Shared UI → `packages/shell-ui` (manifest: `packages/shell-ui/src/package.json`).
- Program `src/` stays a thin host. Do not reimplement chrome in each app.
- `index.html` stays per-program. Prefer `App.svelte` / `main.ts` once converted.

## Theme

- Nord tokens only in `styles/modules/themes/nord-theme.css`, defined once in shell-ui.
- No second theme engine. No per-program palette forks.

## Svelte

- Svelte 5 runes. After writing `.svelte`, run the Svelte MCP autofixer until clean.
- Do not copy the same widget into editor, explorer, and terminal.
